{"seq":2,"slug":"animation-state-machines","title":"动画状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/animation-state-machines","wordCount":880,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"动画状态机\">动画状态机</h1><p>动画状态机（Animation State Machine）是游戏引擎中连接「游戏逻辑状态」和「角色视觉表现」的桥梁。Unity 的 Animator Controller 和 Unreal Engine 的 Animation Blueprint 都以动画状态机为核心，通过参数驱动实现复杂动画的自动切换与混合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>动画状态机与逻辑状态机的关键区别在于：逻辑状态机关注「角色在做什么」，动画状态机关注「角色看起来怎么样」。两者通常分离设计——逻辑状态机驱动动画参数，动画状态机响应参数变化切换动画。这种分离允许美术独立调整动画表现，无需修改游戏逻辑代码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动画状态与混合树\">动画状态与混合树</h2><p>动画状态机中的每个「状态」通常不是单个动画片段，而是一个<strong>混合树（Blend Tree）</strong>，它根据参数值（如速度、方向）在多个动画片段间插值混合。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; LocomotionBlendTree&#10;&#10;    state LocomotionBlendTree {&#10;        Idle --&gt; Walk1D: speed &gt; 0.1&#10;        Walk1D --&gt; Run: speed &gt; 0.7&#10;        Run --&gt; Walk1D: speed &lt;= 0.7&#10;        Walk1D --&gt; Idle: speed &lt;= 0.1&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    LocomotionBlendTree --&gt; JumpStart: isJumping&#10;    JumpStart --&gt; JumpAir: afterFirstFrame&#10;    JumpAir --&gt; JumpLand: isGrounded&#10;    JumpLand --&gt; LocomotionBlendTree: landAnimComplete&#10;&#10;    LocomotionBlendTree --&gt; AttackLayer: attackTrigger\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; LocomotionBlendTree\n\n    state LocomotionBlendTree {\n        Idle --&gt; Walk1D: speed &gt; 0.1\n        Walk1D --&gt; Run: speed &gt; 0.7\n        Run --&gt; Walk1D: speed &lt;= 0.7\n        Walk1D --&gt; Idle: speed &lt;= 0.1\n    }\n\n    LocomotionBlendTree --&gt; JumpStart: isJumping\n    JumpStart --&gt; JumpAir: afterFirstFrame\n    JumpAir --&gt; JumpLand: isGrounded\n    JumpLand --&gt; LocomotionBlendTree: landAnimComplete\n\n    LocomotionBlendTree --&gt; AttackLayer: attackTrigger</pre><p><strong>1D 混合树</strong>（最常见）：按单个浮点参数在多个动画间混合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Speed 参数：&#10;  0.0 → Idle 动画&#10;  0.5 → Walk 动画（100%）&#10;  1.0 → Run 动画&#10;  中间值 → Walk/Run 按比例混合\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Speed 参数：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0.0 → Idle 动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  0.5 → Walk 动画（100%）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1.0 → Run 动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  中间值 → Walk/Run 按比例混合</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2D 混合树</strong>：按两个参数（如 X/Y 方向速度）在多个方向动画间混合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"(VelocityX, VelocityZ) 参数：&#10;  (0, 1)   → 向前走&#10;  (0, -1)  → 向后走&#10;  (1, 0)   → 向右走&#10;  (-1, 0)  → 向左走&#10;  中间值   → 多方向动画加权混合\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(VelocityX, VelocityZ) 参数：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (0, 1)   → 向前走</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (0, -1)  → 向后走</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (1, 0)   → 向右走</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (-1, 0)  → 向左走</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  中间值   → 多方向动画加权混合</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"过渡参数与过渡时长\">过渡参数与过渡时长</h2><p>动画过渡（Transition）是动画状态机最需要精细调整的部分。关键参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>过渡时长（Duration）</td>\n<td>当前动画淡出 + 目标动画淡入的时间</td>\n<td>0.1-0.3s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退出时间（Exit Time）</td>\n<td>当前动画播放到多少比例后才允许过渡</td>\n<td>0.8-1.0（可选）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过渡偏移（Offset）</td>\n<td>目标动画从哪个比例开始播放</td>\n<td>通常 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定时长（Fixed Duration）</td>\n<td>过渡时长是固定秒数还是归一化比例</td>\n<td>建议 fixed</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// 程序化控制动画过渡（Unity）&#10;public class AnimationController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private Animator animator;&#10;&#10;    // 动画参数 ID 缓存（避免每帧字符串查找）&#10;    private static readonly int SpeedHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Speed&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int IsGroundedHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;IsGrounded&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int IsJumpingHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;IsJumping&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int AttackTriggerHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;AttackTrigger&quot;);&#10;    private static readonly int HitTriggerHash = Animator.StringToHash(&quot;HitTrigger&quot;);&#10;&#10;    public void UpdateLocomotionParameters(float speed, bool isGrounded)&#10;    {&#10;        // 平滑设置速度参数，避免抖动&#10;        float currentSpeed = animator.GetFloat(SpeedHash);&#10;        float smoothedSpeed = Mathf.Lerp(currentSpeed, speed, Time.deltaTime * 10f);&#10;        animator.SetFloat(SpeedHash, smoothedSpeed);&#10;        animator.SetBool(IsGroundedHash, isGrounded);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TriggerJump()&#10;    {&#10;        animator.SetBool(IsJumpingHash, true);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void OnLanded()&#10;    {&#10;        animator.SetBool(IsJumpingHash, false);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    public void TriggerAttack()&#10;    {&#10;        animator.SetTrigger(AttackTriggerHash);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 程序化控制动画过渡（Unity）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class AnimationController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Animator animator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 动画参数 ID 缓存（避免每帧字符串查找）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int SpeedHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"Speed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int IsGroundedHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"IsGrounded\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int IsJumpingHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"IsJumping\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int AttackTriggerHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"AttackTrigger\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private static readonly int HitTriggerHash = Animator.StringToHash(\"HitTrigger\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void UpdateLocomotionParameters(float speed, bool isGrounded)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 平滑设置速度参数，避免抖动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float currentSpeed = animator.GetFloat(SpeedHash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float smoothedSpeed = Mathf.Lerp(currentSpeed, speed, Time.deltaTime * 10f);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetFloat(SpeedHash, smoothedSpeed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetBool(IsGroundedHash, isGrounded);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TriggerJump()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetBool(IsJumpingHash, true);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void OnLanded()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetBool(IsJumpingHash, false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void TriggerAttack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetTrigger(AttackTriggerHash);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"any-state-过渡\">Any-State 过渡</h2><p><strong>Any-State</strong> 是动画状态机中的特殊节点，定义在 Any-State 上的过渡表示「无论当前处于哪个状态，只要满足条件就触发」。典型用途：被击中、死亡、被打飞等需要立即打断当前动画的情况。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Any State → HitReaction（触发条件：HitTrigger）&#10;Any State → Death（触发条件：IsDead = true）&#10;Any State → StaggerAir（触发条件：IsKnockedback &amp;&amp; !IsGrounded）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Any State → HitReaction（触发条件：HitTrigger）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Any State → Death（触发条件：IsDead = true）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Any State → StaggerAir（触发条件：IsKnockedback &#x26;&#x26; !IsGrounded）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Any-State 过渡的注意事项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免 Any-State 指向本身可能是过渡起点的状态，会造成循环触发</li>\n<li>被 Any-State 打断的过渡，应在该状态的 OnEnter 中确保参数被正确重置</li>\n<li>打断类过渡通常设置 Interruption Source = CurrentState，允许打断正在进行的过渡</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"子状态机\">子状态机</h2><p>当某个高层状态内部有复杂的动画逻辑时，可以将其提取为<strong>子状态机（Sub-State Machine）</strong>，保持顶层状态机的清晰度：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"顶层状态机&#10;├── Locomotion（子状态机）&#10;│   ├── Idle&#10;│   ├── Walk（混合树）&#10;│   └── Run（混合树）&#10;├── Jump（子状态机）&#10;│   ├── JumpStart&#10;│   ├── JumpAir&#10;│   └── JumpLand&#10;└── Combat（子状态机）&#10;    ├── Idle&#10;    ├── Attack1&#10;    ├── Attack2&#10;    └── BlockReact\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>顶层状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Locomotion（子状态机）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── Walk（混合树）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── Run（混合树）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── Jump（子状态机）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── JumpStart</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── JumpAir</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── JumpLand</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── Combat（子状态机）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Attack1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── Attack2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── BlockReact</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"骨骼层-animation-layer\">骨骼层（Animation Layer）</h2><p>动画分层允许上半身和下半身播放不同的动画，实现「边走路边举枪」等效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"// Unity 中的动画层设置&#10;// Layer 0（Base Layer，权重1.0）：腿部/全身动画（走路、跑步、跳跃）&#10;// Layer 1（UpperBody Layer，权重1.0，Avatar Mask：上半身）：手臂/武器动画&#10;&#10;public class LayeredAnimationController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private Animator animator;&#10;    private const int BASE_LAYER = 0;&#10;    private const int UPPER_BODY_LAYER = 1;&#10;&#10;    // 切换武器姿势（只影响上半身层）&#10;    public void SetWeaponStance(WeaponStance stance)&#10;    {&#10;        int stanceHash = stance switch&#10;        {&#10;            WeaponStance.Unarmed =&gt; Animator.StringToHash(&quot;Unarmed&quot;),&#10;            WeaponStance.Pistol =&gt; Animator.StringToHash(&quot;PistolAim&quot;),&#10;            WeaponStance.Rifle =&gt; Animator.StringToHash(&quot;RifleAim&quot;),&#10;            _ =&gt; 0&#10;        };&#10;&#10;        animator.SetInteger(&quot;WeaponStance&quot;, (int)stance);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 动态调整层权重（如受伤时减少上半身动画影响）&#10;    public void SetUpperBodyWeight(float weight)&#10;    {&#10;        animator.SetLayerWeight(UPPER_BODY_LAYER,&#10;            Mathf.Clamp01(weight));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Unity 中的动画层设置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Layer 0（Base Layer，权重1.0）：腿部/全身动画（走路、跑步、跳跃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Layer 1（UpperBody Layer，权重1.0，Avatar Mask：上半身）：手臂/武器动画</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>public class LayeredAnimationController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Animator animator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private const int BASE_LAYER = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private const int UPPER_BODY_LAYER = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 切换武器姿势（只影响上半身层）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SetWeaponStance(WeaponStance stance)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        int stanceHash = stance switch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            WeaponStance.Unarmed => Animator.StringToHash(\"Unarmed\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            WeaponStance.Pistol => Animator.StringToHash(\"PistolAim\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            WeaponStance.Rifle => Animator.StringToHash(\"RifleAim\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _ => 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetInteger(\"WeaponStance\", (int)stance);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 动态调整层权重（如受伤时减少上半身动画影响）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void SetUpperBodyWeight(float weight)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animator.SetLayerWeight(UPPER_BODY_LAYER,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Mathf.Clamp01(weight));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"根运动-root-motion\">根运动（Root Motion）</h2><p>根运动（Root Motion）允许角色的位移和旋转由动画片段驱动，而不是由物理/代码驱动。适合需要精确位移的动作（翻滚、特定攻击的位移跟进）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"public class RootMotionController : MonoBehaviour&#10;{&#10;    private Animator animator;&#10;    private bool useRootMotion = false;&#10;&#10;    // 由动画事件控制是否启用根运动&#10;    private void OnAnimatorMove()&#10;    {&#10;        if (useRootMotion)&#10;        {&#10;            // 应用动画驱动的位移&#10;            Vector3 rootMotionDelta = animator.deltaPosition;&#10;            Quaternion rootRotationDelta = animator.deltaRotation;&#10;&#10;            // 可以在这里做额外处理，如 Y 轴根运动与物理结合&#10;            rootMotionDelta.y = 0; // 忽略 Y 轴根运动，用物理代替&#10;            transform.position += rootMotionDelta;&#10;            transform.rotation *= rootRotationDelta;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 攻击动画开始时启用根运动&#10;    public void EnableRootMotionForAttack()&#10;    {&#10;        useRootMotion = true;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 攻击动画结束时关闭根运动&#10;    public void DisableRootMotion()&#10;    {&#10;        useRootMotion = false;&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>public class RootMotionController : MonoBehaviour</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private Animator animator;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private bool useRootMotion = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 由动画事件控制是否启用根运动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private void OnAnimatorMove()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (useRootMotion)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 应用动画驱动的位移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Vector3 rootMotionDelta = animator.deltaPosition;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Quaternion rootRotationDelta = animator.deltaRotation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            // 可以在这里做额外处理，如 Y 轴根运动与物理结合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            rootMotionDelta.y = 0; // 忽略 Y 轴根运动，用物理代替</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transform.position += rootMotionDelta;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            transform.rotation *= rootRotationDelta;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 攻击动画开始时启用根运动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void EnableRootMotionForAttack()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        useRootMotion = true;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 攻击动画结束时关闭根运动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public void DisableRootMotion()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        useRootMotion = false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>动画状态机通过参数与混合树将游戏逻辑状态映射为流畅的视觉表现。关键设计点是：用参数 Hash 缓存避免性能浪费，合理设置过渡时长让动画切换自然，用 Any-State 处理高优先级打断，用骨骼层叠加上下半身独立动画。动画状态机是「代码驱动动画」的接口层，美术与程序分工的边界。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"character-controller-states\">角色控制器状态</a> — 驱动动画状态机的逻辑状态机设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"game-flow-management\">游戏流程管理</a> — 游戏暂停/结束时如何正确暂停动画状态机</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"动画状态机","id":"动画状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动画状态与混合树","id":"动画状态与混合树"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡参数与过渡时长","id":"过渡参数与过渡时长"},{"level":2,"text":"Any-State 过渡","id":"any-state-过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"子状态机","id":"子状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"骨骼层（Animation Layer）","id":"骨骼层-animation-layer"},{"level":2,"text":"根运动（Root Motion）","id":"根运动-root-motion"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"角色控制器状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/character-controller-states"},"next":{"title":"游戏流程管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-state-machines/game-applications/game-flow-management"}}